(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DFA}\">\\(\\mathrm{DFA}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REGULAR}\">\\(\\mathrm{REGULAR}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(M)\">\\(L(M)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6d26348026d8f259\" href=\"?note=6d26348026d8f259\" title=\"73-df-dfa-notation\">73-df-dfa-notation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"11d1c892f16eef2d\" href=\"?note=11d1c892f16eef2d\" title=\"73-df-dfa-acceptance-notation\">73-df-dfa-acceptance-notation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a2d140de13ec8897\" href=\"?note=a2d140de13ec8897\" title=\"73-df-regular-language-notation\">73-df-regular-language-notation</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathrm{DFA}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathrm{DFA}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{REGULAR}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{REGULAR}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{pump}\">\\(\\mathrm{pump}\\)</span> 的两个类型实例分别以机器和正则语言为参数，省略类型标注不改变其声明类型。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}3.2}\\vdash\n(\\mathrm{pump}:\\mathrm{DFA}\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0})(M)\\coloneqq |Q|\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}3.2}\\vdash\n(\\mathrm{pump}:\\mathrm{DFA}\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0})(M)\\coloneqq |Q|\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}3.2}\\vdash\n(\\mathrm{pump}:\\mathrm{REGULAR}\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0})(L)\\coloneqq\n\\min\\{n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}:\\exists Q&#39;,\\delta&#39;,q&#39;_0,F&#39;\\;\n((Q&#39;,\\Sigma,\\delta&#39;,q&#39;_0,F&#39;)\\in\\mathrm{DFA}\\land\nL=L((Q&#39;,\\Sigma,\\delta&#39;,q&#39;_0,F&#39;))\\land |Q&#39;|=n)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}3.2}\\vdash\n(\\mathrm{pump}:\\mathrm{REGULAR}\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0})(L)\\coloneqq\n\\min\\{n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}:\\exists Q&#39;,\\delta&#39;,q&#39;_0,F&#39;\\;\n((Q&#39;,\\Sigma,\\delta&#39;,q&#39;_0,F&#39;)\\in\\mathrm{DFA}\\land\nL=L((Q&#39;,\\Sigma,\\delta&#39;,q&#39;_0,F&#39;))\\land |Q&#39;|=n)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留状态数／最小状态数的原对象；不把 pump 改成最小可泵长度。机器与语言的类型标注解决重载，候选自然数的存在由正则性保证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-dfa-notation","status":"resolved","id":"6d26348026d8f259","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dfa-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-acceptance-notation","status":"resolved","id":"11d1c892f16eef2d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dfa-acceptance-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-regular-language-notation","status":"resolved","id":"a2d140de13ec8897","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-regular-language-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-notation","status":"resolved","id":"6d26348026d8f259","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\Sigma$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；$\\mathrm{DFA}$、$\\mathrm{REGULAR}$ 及 $L(M)$ 见 [[73-df-dfa-notation]]、[[73-df-dfa-acceptance-notation]]、[[73-df-regular-language-notation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-acceptance-notation","status":"resolved","id":"11d1c892f16eef2d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\Sigma$ 满足 $